        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p>Five Seele Schneider planted in a pentacle, and the Gint&#333; poured over them.</p><p><strong>20-foot burst</strong> within 60 feet, basic Reflex, <strong>force</strong> damage.</p><p>Creatures that critically fail are <strong>restrained</strong> by lines of light for 1 minute (Escape against your Reiatsu DC).</p><hr /><p><em>Canon's fifth and largest Gint&#333;, and the reason Ury&#363;'s Vollst&auml;ndig does not carry it.</em></p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
